# cursor-cta (fix-cursor): the pointer over the welcome page's Function Viewer
# link, default again over the title. CTA centre probed at (233,553.5),
# title at (270,324); the move between them never crosses the hero.
route welcome
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
reduced-motion on
wait 2000
move 233 553.5
wait 300
shot cursor-cta
move 270 324
wait 300
shot cursor-cta-leave
